{"total_count":3,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/63972","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/63972/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/63972/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/63972/events","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/63972","id":3499385131,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAQzde86s6LXV","number":63972,"title":"Fix hot reload for Blazor route changes","user":{"login":"oroztocil","id":79744616,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NzQ0NjE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79744616?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oroztocil","html_url":"https://github.com/oroztocil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oroztocil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oroztocil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oroztocil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oroztocil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oroztocil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oroztocil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oroztocil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oroztocil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oroztocil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":1164776385,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTY0Nzc2Mzg1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/area-blazor","name":"area-blazor","color":"5319e7","default":false,"description":"Includes: Blazor, Razor Components","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestones/362","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestone/362","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestones/362/labels","id":13536541,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAQzde84Azo0d","number":362,"title":"11.0-preview1","description":"","creator":{"login":"wtgodbe","id":14283640,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjgzNjQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14283640?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe","html_url":"https://github.com/wtgodbe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":469,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-08-21T15:54:42Z","updated_at":"2026-04-29T17:55:18Z","due_on":"2026-02-10T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2026-04-27T13:39:39Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-10-09T14:17:07Z","updated_at":"2025-10-09T18:25:43Z","closed_at":"2025-10-09T18:25:23Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/pulls/63972","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/63972","diff_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/63972.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/63972.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-09T18:25:23Z"},"body":"Fixes two bugs that prevented hot reload from applying changes in Blazor routes.\r\n\r\n### Premature change token disposal\r\n\r\nA bug introduced in https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/53750 caused the change token used by `RazorComponentEndpointDataSource` to be disposed before the callback registered on the token is invoked. This means that `UpdateEndpoints` is not being called at all during hot reload.\r\n\r\nThis PR does not remove the token disposal so that the memory leak is not re-introduced. Instead, the PR moves the disposal of the current token to `UpdateEndpoints` itself. This is valid because the role of the change token is precisely to trigger the update and the token is replaced at the end of `UpdateEndpoints` with a new one (as before).\r\n\r\n### Stale route data\r\n\r\nThe first bug was previously hiding a further problem in how we cache route data used by the main ASP.NET Core routing. This data was computed once during application start up and then reused in every `UpdateEndpoints` invocation. This means that we did not re-scan the assemblies for added, modified, or removed routes.\r\n\r\nThe PR changes the implementation of `RazorComponentEndpointDataSource` and related types so that we do not store a pre-built instance of `ComponentApplicationBuilder`. Instead we store a list of configuration actions that were invoked for the current `RazorComponentEndpointDataSource`. When the route data needs to be updated, these actions are replayed on a new `ComponentApplicationBuilder` instance, thus ensuring an up-to-date state. Note that this follows the same pattern as we already use for endpoint conventions.\r\n\r\n### Result\r\n\r\nAfter the change, hot reload works as expected in the following scenarios:\r\n\r\n- A route is changed or added for an existing page.\r\n- A route is added for a new page.\r\n\r\nHot reload still does not work when deleting a page with route.\r\n\r\n\r\nFixes #52582","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/63972/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/63972/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/63976","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/63976/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/63976/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/63976/events","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/63976","id":3499944162,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAQzde86s8Cs2","number":63976,"title":"[release/10.0] Fix hot reload for Blazor route changes","user":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":985473549,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5ODU0NzM1NDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/Servicing-approved","name":"Servicing-approved","color":"048708","default":false,"description":"Shiproom has approved the issue","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2806766946,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODA2NzY2OTQ2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/feature-hot-reload","name":"feature-hot-reload","color":"bfdad8","default":false,"description":"This issue is related to the Hot Reload feaature","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestones/366","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestone/366","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestones/366/labels","id":13755650,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAQzde84A0eUC","number":366,"title":"10.0.0","description":null,"creator":{"login":"wtgodbe","id":14283640,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjgzNjQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14283640?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe","html_url":"https://github.com/wtgodbe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtgodbe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":45,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-09-24T15:14:32Z","updated_at":"2026-04-27T13:43:47Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-04-27T13:43:47Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-10-09T17:00:16Z","updated_at":"2025-10-10T15:19:06Z","closed_at":"2025-10-10T15:18:40Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/pulls/63976","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/63976","diff_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/63976.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/63976.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-10T15:18:40Z"},"body":"Backport of #63972 to release/10.0\r\n\r\n/cc @javiercn @oroztocil\r\n\r\n# Fix hot reload for Blazor route changes\r\n\r\n## Description\r\n\r\nFix Premature change token disposal introduced in https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/53750  \r\nand change the implementation of RazorComponentEndpointDataSource  to update route data when hot reload is triggered. \r\n\r\nFixes #52582\r\n\r\n## Customer Impact\r\n\r\nFixes a hot reload issue\r\n\r\n## Regression?\r\n\r\n- [ ] Yes\r\n- [x] No\r\n\r\n[If yes, specify the version the behavior has regressed from]\r\n\r\n## Risk\r\n\r\n- [ ] High\r\n- [ ] Medium\r\n- [x] Low\r\n\r\n[Justify the selection above]\r\n\r\n## Verification\r\n\r\n- [x] Manual (required)\r\n- [x] Automated\r\n\r\n## Packaging changes reviewed?\r\n\r\n- [ ] Yes\r\n- [ ] No\r\n- [x] N/A\r\n\r\n----\r\n\r\n## When servicing release/2.3\r\n\r\n- [ ] Make necessary changes in eng/PatchConfig.props\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/63976/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/63976/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/50031","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspne